  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconsidering the potential of water resources development to expand irrigated land in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current project aims to reconsider irrigation potential in Rwanda to increase the total irrigated land to maximize crop production and productivity, sustainable land use and crop intensification, adaption to environmental degradation and climate resilience.</narrative>
